Package: kitJoin
Title: KIT Multi-Wave Data Processing Tool
Version: 0.9.1
Date: 2026-11-03
Authors@R: person("Jie-Wen", "Tsai", email = "tsai.jiewen@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny application for processing multi-wave survey data (CSV, Excel,
    SPSS SAV and Stata DTA). Launch with \code{run_kitjoin()}. Supports wide joins by ID,
    long-format stacking, attrition flags, missing-value code conversion,
    post-join validation, and export to CSV, SAV or DTA with a codebook. The interface is built
    with the shared KIT UI package kitDesign.
